          "case_scope": {
            "source_section": "Statement",
            "source_excerpt": "For the construction in [[def-tdmath-type-offset-vector-space]], $F$ and $N$ are sets, $F$ is a real vector space, $N$ is a linear subspace of $F$, and $F/N$ has representative-independent vector operations making it a real vector space. Its displayed product and positive-scaling relations hold in the quotient.",
