          "reason": "Take two types with fixed totals $T_1=T_2=1$ and a common meter satisfying the compatibility hypotheses of [[thm-tdmath-common-meter-calibration]]. Boundary iff-forward: The Statement is not an if-and-only-if claim.",
          "case_scope": {
